&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Konrad Group is a next generation digital consultancy. We are dedicated to solving complex business problems for our global clients with creative and forward-thinking solutions. Our employees enjoy a culture built on innovation and a commitment to creating best-in-class digital products in use by hundreds of millions of consumers around the world. We hire exceptionally smart, analytical, and hard working people who are lifelong learners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;about-the-role&quot; class=&quot;careers-details__desc-section-title&quot; data-content-jump-link=&quot;true&quot;&gt;About The Role&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Senior UX/UI Designer who brings a blend of strong design execution, strategic thinking, and collaborative leadership to each project. You’ll help shape thoughtful and visually striking digital experiences across web and mobile platforms, working closely with cross-disciplinary teams and clients. From early discovery through final delivery, you’ll translate complex requirements into polished designs that meet both business and user needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 class=&quot;careers-details__desc-section-title&quot;&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design best-in-class experiences and interfaces with high attention to craft, usability, and polish&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver thoughtful, pixel-perfect design systems, interactions, and flows in Figma&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead design workstreams within projects, from research and ideation through execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply UX research, usability insights, and product data to refine and evolve designs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present work clearly to internal teams and external stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with other designers, strategists, developers, and clients to find the strongest solution together&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance multiple projects and deliverables with attention to quality and detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be dependable when faced with timelines and deliverables of multiple projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide thoughtful, constructive feedback and support the growth of junior designers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay informed on design trends, tools, and emerging patterns to bring fresh thinking to your work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;qualifications&quot; class=&quot;careers-details__desc-section-title&quot; data-content-jump-link=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Qualifications&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3-5 years of experience in UX/UI design with a minimum of 1 year of experience in leading UX and UI design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong portfolio showcasing UX thinking, interaction design, and visual design execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced proficiency in Figma and familiarity with prototyping tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to synthesize research, data, and business requirements into actionable designs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and presentation skills, with the ability to advocate for design decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working on complex digital products or platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable navigating ambiguity and collaborating across disciplines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reliable, self-directed, and committed to high-quality design outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced English Level required&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Please note: A portfolio link is required for consideration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Perks and Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive Health &amp;amp; Wellness Benefits Package&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Parental Leave Program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual tech &amp;amp; travel allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible Working Hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work from Home Flexibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Service Recognition Programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Socials, Outings &amp;amp; Retreats&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Culture of Learning &amp;amp; Development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 class=&quot;careers-details__desc-section-title&quot;&gt;Bonus Points&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Have you taken any courses at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://brainstation.io/&quot;&gt;BrainStation&lt;/a&gt;? A lot of our design and development best practices and processes are taught during our courses - make sure to highlight this experience in your cover letter if you have!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Konrad is committed to maintaining a diverse work environment and is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. All qualified applicants, regardless of race, color, religion, gender, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, national origin, genetics, disability, age, or veteran status will receive consideration for employment. If you have any accessibility requirements or concerns regarding the hiring process or employment with us, please notify us so we can provide suitable accommodation.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While we sincerely appreciate all applications, only those candidates selected for an interview will be contacted.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;
